{"repositoryId":1265726411,"availability":"available","full":"mikelmyers/argus-demo","name":"argus-demo","description":"Live demo for argus-diff: the GitHub Action comments geometric diffs on this repo's PRs. See PR #2.","category":"Other","language":"Python","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-06-11T03:07:02Z","updated":"2026-06-11T03:33:55Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://argusdiff.com","topics":["cad","demo","github-actions","step"],"demo":"https://argusdiff.com/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-18T11:31:17.766Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-18T11:31:17.766Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-18T11:31:17.766Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-18T11:31:17.766Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A tiny repo that exists to show argus-diff working on pull requests. cad/bracket.step is a sensor-mount bracket; open a PR that changes it and the Argus action comments the geometric diff — bodies added/removed/modified, mass delta, face-level changes, interference — with renders attached as artifacts.","Try it: fork, regenerate the bracket with different parameters (python makebracket.py --thickness 8 --hole 6), open a PR.","The live demo PR in this repo changes the plate thickness 6→8 mm, opens the corner holes ⌀5→⌀6, grows the boss, adds a gusset, and deletes a locating pin. The action catches all of it, including a deliberate 109 mm³ gusset/boss interference."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/mikelmyers/argus-demo/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"e3c34bc27f9893a080b8d7fb15b1399e3f31fee24117c5ba77e695359fef8190","extractedAt":"2026-10-18T11:31:17.869Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-18T11:31:17.869Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A tiny repo that exists to show argus-diff working on pull requests. cad/bracket.step is a sensor-mount bracket; open a PR that changes it and the Argus action comments the geometric diff — bodies added/removed/modified, mass